# .copilotignore
#
# ⚠ NOTE — UNOFFICIAL FILE
# `.copilotignore` is NOT a documented GitHub Copilot feature; it is widely
# used as a community convention but is not parsed by the official Copilot
# extension. See: https://github.com/orgs/community/discussions/10305
#
# The OFFICIAL mechanism for excluding files from Copilot is:
#   • Repository / Organization → Settings → Copilot → Content exclusion (UI)
#   • REST API (public preview, Feb 2026):
#     https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/concepts/context/content-exclusion
#
# This file is kept here as a defense-in-depth signal for tooling that DOES
# honor it (some third-party AI coding extensions, internal proxies, etc.)
# and as a checked-in inventory of what the team considers off-limits.
# For real enforcement, configure content exclusion at repo/org level too.
#
# Syntax is the same as .gitignore. Does NOT affect git — files are still
# tracked.

# ── Build artefacts (large, no signal for code generation) ──────────────────
target/
build/
dist/
out/
*.class
*.jar
*.war
*.ear

# ── Terraform state (sensitive, not useful for code gen) ─────────────────────
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.backup
**/.terraform/
*.tfplan
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example       # ← keep examples (useful for understanding variables)

# ── Secrets and credentials (NEVER send to any AI model) ─────────────────────
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.jks
**/*.pfx
**/*.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/secrets/
**/credentials/

# ── Generated code (low signal, high token cost) ─────────────────────────────
**/generated/
**/*_pb2.py             # Python protobuf generated
**/*.pb.go              # Go protobuf generated

# ── Vendor / dependencies (already known by models from training) ─────────────
vendor/
node_modules/

# ── IDE and OS noise ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
*.iml
.DS_Store
*.swp

# ── Logs (runtime data, not useful for understanding code) ───────────────────
*.log
*.hprof
hs_err_pid*.log

# ── Sensitive test fixtures ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/testdata/fixtures/prod-*
**/testdata/snapshots/real-*
